      "content": "i hear you, but i'm finding it hard to square \"benefiting the global economy\" with the fact that these policies are literally designed to make things harder for other countries to compete. if a country is just trying to protect its own interests at the expense of everyone else, isn't that just the definition of an unstable and selfish economic model?",
